title: 'Registrar: deregister'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |-
      Implements `pallet-registrar-para::deregister`. An id the relay chain never onboarded is
      dropped locally. Otherwise both deposits stay held until the relay chain answers, and if the
      answer never arrives the manager calls `deregister` again after `PendingDeadline`.

      `pallet-registrar-relay` applies a `Deregister` and reports back. A para that is already
      gone or offboarding is confirmed, so a retry settles. `paras_registrar` implements
      `ParachainRegistrar::deregister` for parathreads without origin or lock checks, since those
      belong to the parachain that took the deposit. A refusal is reported as the new
      `FailureReason::NotDeregisterable`.

crates:
  - name: registrar-primitives
    bump: major
  - name: pallet-registrar-para
    bump: major
  - name: pallet-registrar-relay
    bump: major
  - name: polkadot-runtime-common
    bump: patch
